Rule 1 (input must be 3D or 4D; zero batch allowed; other dims strictly positive)
{v_1 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 3) > 0) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = 3 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 2) > 0)
